# Changelog

Luca Plian:

### Added
- Prometheus for metrics collection
- Grafana for visualization of the metrics
- Docker Compose setup for all services
- PGAdmin for managing the PostgreSQL database
- Portainer for visualising and managing the Docker cluster
- Frontend (Vite + React)
- Backend (.NET 8)

Beiu Alexandru:

### Added
- Added Kong API Gateway to manage routing between microservices (only to Docker Compose for now)
- Added Kong PostGreSQL database and migrations
- Added the following routes that Kong will expect requests:
    - AuthService to /auth/[path] 
    - CatalogService to /catalog/[path]
    - BookingService to /booking/[path]

### Changed
- Updated frontend routes so that all requests go through Kong (localhost:8000)
- Updated Docker Compose file to include Kong services and network

### Fixed
- Some typos for romanian translation